{"asset_key":"timeline/quest_story_15107100","episode":"timeline","category":"quest_story","story_id":"15107100","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"cinematic_dialogue:2:1510709001:":{"text":"お兄ちゃん！","source_cn":"哥哥！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF92AECAA62274ED2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:2:1510709002:":{"text":"まだここにいるの？","source_cn":"哥哥，你怎么还没走呀！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB599CF8657A16831","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:2:1510709003:":{"text":"お、俺は……","source_cn":"我、我……<key:dialog2>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA9AE1C156FA83E0A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1510710001:0":{"text":"お兄ちゃん、司令官さまはもう北に行っちゃったよ。ついていかないの？","source_cn":"哥哥，统帅大人从城北走了，你不跟上他的队伍吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0D969356CDCB727C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1510710002:0":{"text":"……あのな、お兄ちゃんにだって、怖いものはあるんだ。","source_cn":"……唉，你不懂，哥哥也有害怕的事……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF69E321FF76D6E3B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1510710003:0":{"text":"え、怖いの？……そういえば、ベディのお父さん、戦いに行ったきり戻ってこないって言ってた……","source_cn":"你……你是害怕吗？我听说贝迪说，他父亲出征后就再也没回来……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x206D722B01C24AAE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1510710004:0":{"text":"いいか、ジュニ。司令官様の部隊が進むルートは、もう片方よりも危険なんだ。","source_cn":"朱尼，你仔细听我说，统帅这支队伍……路线比较危险。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0DEF2D5D6D342681","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1510710005:0":{"text":"危険……どれぐらい危険なの？","source_cn":"危险……有多危险？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1ED9001BD9C0D936","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1510710006:0":{"text":"もし、お兄ちゃんも戻ってこなくなったら……","source_cn":"要是……要是去了就再也回不来的话……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x63D86D69486025A7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1510710007:0":{"text":"ま、まさか……子どものくせに、心配しすぎだぞ。","source_cn":"不会的……小小年纪，别担心那么多。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF35D87CCCE807951","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1510710008:0":{"text":"お兄ちゃんはもう行くよ。ジュニ、元気でな。","source_cn":"朱尼，哥哥该走了。你……你要好好照顾自己，知道吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7EEA4EA4E8EFBC8C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1510710009:0":{"text":"お兄ちゃん……","source_cn":"哥哥……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x25BC38C3901D0694","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1510710010:0":{"text":"あの臆病者は、ペルセウスのところに行くみたいだな。","source_cn":"那个懦夫要去追珀尔修斯的队伍。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x062C13B6B17D5348","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1510710011:0":{"text":"<style=\"highlight\">あいつを尾行</style>すれば、奴のルートと目的もはっきりするはずだ。","source_cn":"<style=highlight>跟着他</style...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCBDED8EEEA5B292F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1510710012:0":{"text":"ロンゴスの主力部隊も無視できないぞ……","source_cn":"隆尔副将带领的主力军队也不能放着不管……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4EE1391356171A39","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1510710013:0":{"text":"こっちも二手に分かれるか？","source_cn":"分头行动？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3DD846CD9324A9D1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","do